			x: 2.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4707632A61002DA6"]
			description: ["Place a &6Waystone&r and use it once to remember the spot. Any waystone you know can take you to any other. Villages often have one already. After your first rocket trip to a planet, jumps cost no XP."]
