			dependencies: ["4F6670F0CBAD4003"]
			description: ["&6/sethome&r marks a spot and &6/home&r brings you back to it from anywhere, other dimensions included. &6/back&r returns you to where you last teleported or died, and &6/spawn&r to the world spawn. Every new world gives you ten FTB homes, and waystones cover the rest."]
